### --- Inbox poll: every provisioned @cargopax.ca mailbox with IMAP creds
### and the last uid recorded (API key auth)
GET {{host}}/api/queries/mailboxes-to-poll
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### What the poll posts for each new message (body kept as the event's blob)
POST {{host}}/api/commands/record-email-message-received
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "messageId": "<order-48213@shop.example>",
  "uid": 7,
  "uidValidity": 1001,
  "subject": "Fwd: Your order has shipped",
  "from": "Jane <jane@example.com>",
  "to": "jane@cargopax.ca",
  "receivedAt": 1787490000000,
  "text": "Track it: https://www.ups.com/track?tracknum=1Z999AA10123456784",
  "html": ""
}

### --- Email processing: forwarded emails not yet read for tracking links
GET {{host}}/api/queries/email-messages-to-process
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### The message body
GET {{host}}/api/queries/email-message-content?tenantId={{tenantId}}&messageId=%3Corder-48213%40shop.example%3E
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### A tracker started from an email (409 if that shipment is already tracked)
POST {{host}}/api/commands/start-tracking-shipment
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "url": "https://www.ups.com/track?tracknum=1Z999AA10123456784",
  "shipmentCompany": "ups",
  "trackingNumber": "1Z999AA10123456784",
  "label": "Lee Valley via UPS for Jane",
  "messageId": "<order-48213@shop.example>"
}

### Done with the email
POST {{host}}/api/commands/mark-email-message-as-processed
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "messageId": "<order-48213@shop.example>",
  "trackerIds": ["{{trackerId}}"],
  "note": ""
}

### --- Tracker refresh: every tracker waiting on a scrape, best first.
### Each poll also pumps the in-process jobs (mailboxes, emails).
GET {{host}}/api/queries/refresh-requests
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### What the processor posts back after reading the carrier page. Dates are
### YYYY-MM-DD or ''; only new/changed values become events.
POST {{host}}/api/commands/update-tracking-shipment-status
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenantId}}",
  "trackerId": "{{trackerId}}",
  "labelCreatedOnDate": "2026-08-21",
  "onTheWayDate": "2026-08-22",
  "outForDeliveryDate": "",
  "estimatedDeliveryDate": "2026-08-30",
  "deliveredOnDate": "",
  "errorMessage": ""
}

### --- Operational: is the mail domain live on Migadu, and if not, which
### DNS records are still missing (?recheck=1 forces a live run)
GET {{host}}/api/queries/mail-domain?recheck=1
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
